# PQ-006: Separate magnesium and calcium in two precipitation stages
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CaCl2 0.0005mol
add v1 Mg(OH)2 0.0005mol
add v1 HCl 0.001mol
add v1 NaOH 0.001mol
new
filter v1 v2
add v2 Na2CO3 0.0006mol
new
filter v2 v3
inspect
